            "sid": "GEN 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo Mlungu ŵamsalile Adamu kuti, “Ligongo m'mweji mwapikanile ŵamkwenu, mpaka mlile yisogosi yinamgombelecesye kuti mkamlya. Litaka tiliŵe lyakulweseka ligongo lya yimtesileyi. Mkwenela kukamula masengo ga citukuta, ndaŵi ja umi wenu wosope, kuti mpate yakulya yakwanila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
